Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:18.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is this Lt. Col. Roy Mustang? \NMy humble name is Edward Elric...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humble?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:32.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right! We'll be boarding the 9:20 train bound for Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one before that, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes there is, but it sounds like it's already leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now departing! Now departing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hop aboard that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm testing their luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:12.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get Lt. Col. Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,am I scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't say—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, there's someone strange over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marin, that's not nice. Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For him to wear his armor inside the train, \Nhe must really like it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing particularly strange about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:17.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see? \NShe likes you! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There now, Marin, \Nthat's enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looks like they're tuckered out \Nfrom too much romping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:54.90,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I'm so glad that you've been able to travel \Nlike this without any incident, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said that the situation to the east was unstable, but then here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.22,0:05:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My, my, the higher-ups sure do take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, where is \NMaj. Hughes right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is communicating with\NLt. Col. Mustang about that other matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That other matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:25.22,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,{\an8}Ever since my wife got pregnant, \Nshe's been getting prettier by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's like an angel who has \Nwaltzed her way down to earth—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:30.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got cut off again. What lousy conditions for communications!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one we \Ncan't do anything with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd better make another round to keep myself from worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, listen, what am I going to do if the baby is born tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hughes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard this story \Nabout fifty times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:06:00.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to talk about this, \Ntake it up with your wife directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have! Just a little while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pardon me for breaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, a piece of advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The baby won't be born after just five months!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't hear too well \Nover this phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just got confirmation that there's no one monitoring communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:43.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Or so I'd like to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There have been more passengers \Ngetting on and off than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you factor in the private rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:07:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here! \NSomeone awfully suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:00.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're wearing armor this huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy is fine. Is there another...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,pipsqueak together with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pip...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...squeak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was right! He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he really {\i1}is{\i0} little!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:26.46,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Who are you calling so puny that you can only make him out under a magnifying glass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who said so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be quiet! Everyone, put your hands where I can see 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good day, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hughes! What is it?\NHas something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:21.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, inform Bald that \Nwe've taken the wireless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like anyone was using it, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it them, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:48.30,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,There's a call for headquarters from General Hakuro \Naboard the train heading for Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel? Is this Lt. Col. Mustang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:09:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Bald, of the Eastern\NLiberation Front "Blue Squad."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have taken control of this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are your demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We suddenly lost contact with one of our allies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone who was supposed to have delivered a statement to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring our leader in \NPrison No. 8 to Central Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll exchange prisoners there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. In exchange, \Ndo not kill anyone. If you do—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this? \NWe do have a statement here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if the general finds out, \Nhe's going to ask who was responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as the situation gets resolved, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already taken sufficient measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this man Mustang thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he does anything funny, then it won't just be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:07.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Consider all of the passengers dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that you've \Ndone that, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When their buddies come to get back at us for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:09.20,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,If you hadn't resisted, we probably would've gotten to Central without any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:14.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. Your big brothers \Nwill take care of this somehow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:51.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who on earth are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're just ordinary alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Falman. Warrant Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A soldier? You don't look at all like one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a reason why I'm dressed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, up in the first car...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then that's who the criminals are after?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they're dragging all these people into the middle of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, I'll go at them from above. \NYou take them from below with this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something funny going on behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! You'd better not shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:13.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was about to tell you that you risked ricochets by shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.55,0:13:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! You'd better not shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bald! Contact from \Nbehind us has been cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:28.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you {\i1}did{\i0} have something set up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn yourselves over, \Nand release the other passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things aren't just going to go your way this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones giving orders here, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:54.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check all of the cars \Non this train again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:57.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And examine the outside of the cars as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Hughes. Edward Elric-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard about you \Nfrom Lt. Col. Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the Lt. Colonel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.65,0:14:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, you'll work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already checked things out below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.88,0:14:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mess around with the tender! It's the life of this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tender, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't, Bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone outrageous up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bald!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Contact with everywhere else \Nhas been cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said something \Nabout a big suit of armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys in the criminal group, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Threaten everyone else, will you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let the hostages go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Mustang's secret agents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you interfere, \NI'll kill the hostages one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're just itching to do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A water... pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, hostages, please take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the ringleader, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I kill the general,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fellow Automailer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A brat like you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the military using even children now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that "brat" line!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm not being used by anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid, let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to be in the military long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, I thought \NI wanted to be better armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the military didn't seem to like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were afraid of me becoming any stronger on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shortly after I had this operation, they got rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so... And so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to crush the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've got an arm like that, \Nthen you must've wanted it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:34.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to be stronger than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:41.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare lump my arm in...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:12.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, it looks like you did as you were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Mustang, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.41,0:20:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The effect on your body probably isn't as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Roy Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My rank is Lt. Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I am the Flame Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's Mustang...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you... You knew about all of this when you had us board this train, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not as if I had \Na grasp of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly though, I have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His generalship heard \Nabout your exploits,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:21:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and he said he would \Nspecially allow you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to take the State Alchemist Certification Exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Specially?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:08.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we came because you told us to take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way a child could take \Nsuch an important military test, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, aren't you glad that I had you take this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether or not you take the test is still up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:38.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course we're going to take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take it, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, those people had us \Ndancing right in the palm of their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, there was no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:22:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still don't have any power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There he is! Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 6: "State Alchemist \NQualification Exam"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.76,0:23:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone but me thinks \Nit's impossible for Brother to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.02,0:23:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, on that day, \Nmiraculous flowers will bloom.
